.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SH "is-fullwidth-code-point [![Build Status](https://travis-ci.org/sindresorhus/is-fullwidth-code-point.svg?branch=master)](https://travis-ci.org/sindresorhus/is-fullwidth-code-point)"
.PP
.RS 4
Check if the character represented by a given \fRUnicode code point\fP is \fRfullwidth\fP 
.RE
.PP
.SH "Install"
.PP
.PP
.nf
$ npm install is\-fullwidth\-code\-point
.fi
.PP
.SH "Usage"
.PP
.PP
.nf
const isFullwidthCodePoint = require('is\-fullwidth\-code\-point');

isFullwidthCodePoint('谢'\&.codePointAt(0));
//=> true

isFullwidthCodePoint('a'\&.codePointAt(0));
//=> false
.fi
.PP
.SH "API"
.PP
.SS "isFullwidthCodePoint(codePoint)"
.SS "codePoint"
Type: \fRnumber\fP

.PP
The \fRcode point\fP of a character\&.
